---
description: >-
  Five-lane (Car, Sales, Constr, Legal, Fun) car/fun/sales flow with short
  edge labels, rendered top-down using the dedicated `layout: swimlane`
  engine (ignoreCrossLaneEdges/optimizeRanksByCrossings enabled) - the
  TD/swimlane-layout counterpart to `6-legal-constr-sales`, which uses the
  same graph under LR with the default flowchart layout instead.
config:
  logLevel: 0
  flowchart:
    htmlLabels: false
    useMaxWidth: false
  layout: swimlane
  swimlane:
    ignoreCrossLaneEdges: true
    optimizeRanksByCrossings: true
---
swimlane-beta TD
  A --> B --> C --> D --> E --> F --> G
  D --> H --> I --Yes--> J --> E
  I --No--> K --> L --> M & N
  subgraph Car
    A
  end
  subgraph Sales
    B
    M
  end
  subgraph Constr
    C
    D
    E
    H
    L
    N
  end
  subgraph Legal
    I
    J
    K
  end
  subgraph Fun
    F
    G
  end
